name tangocolors
category Package
revision 66733
shortdesc Use colors from the Tango color palette
relocated 1
longdesc The Tango color palette defines some color names and their RGB
longdesc codes. This LaTeX macro package implements these color names,
longdesc so one can easily access these colors by their names. The
longdesc package relies on the xcolor package, so please refer to the
longdesc documentation to that package to learn how to access the
longdesc defined colors.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/tangocolors/tangocolors.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/dgsiegel/latex-tangocolors/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/dgsiegel/latex-tangocolors
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/tangocolors
catalogue-license lppl1.3 gpl
catalogue-topics colour
catalogue-version 0.3
